<title>USA: TNP Enterprises Inc Q4 shr $0.12 vs $0.22.</title>
<headline>TNP Enterprises Inc Q4 shr $0.12 vs $0.22.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands except per share amounts)</p>
<p>				     Three Months Ended  Year Ended</p>
<p>					    Dec. 31,	 Dec. 31,</p>
<p>					1996    1995    1996     1995</p>
<p> Operating revenues	 $123,437 $107,353 $502,737 $485,823</p>
<p> Net operating income	 20,828   19,304   95,177   96,595</p>
<p> Net earnings		    1,669    2,522   24,353   41,505</p>
<p>Weighted average common</p>
<p>  shares outstanding	  13,032   10,915   11,543   10,901</p>
<p>Earnings per share of</p>
<p>  common stock		    0.12     0.22     2.10     3.75</p>
<p>NOTES:  Excluding a loss related to the start-up operations of a unit, Facility Works Inc, fourth quarter earnings for 1966 were $3.7 million ($0.29 per share), an increase of $1.4 million ($0.07 per share) over the fourth quarter of 1995.</p>
<p>Improved 1996 annual results were attributable to higher base revenues and lower interest charges.</p>
<p>Earnings per share were also affected by the dilutive effect of the issuance of two million shares of common stock in October 1996.</p>
<p>--(New York Newsdesk, 212 859-1610)</p>
</text>
